{# ================================================================
   AAIF Presentation Template — reference gallery
   ----------------------------------------------------------------
   This deck is not a talk. It is a slide-for-slide rebuild of the
   official "AAIF Presentation Template" Google Slides deck
   (Slides.pptx, 23 slides) using only this brand pack's macros —
   same copy, same order, same offsets. Keeping the sample text
   identical to the source is deliberate: it makes the two decks
   diffable side by side, which is how the pack stays aligned.

   When you start a real AAIF deck, copy this file, delete the
   slides you do not need, and replace the copy.

   Run it:   cd presentations/aaif-template && task start

   Every slide below goes through the brand pack — there is no raw
   HTML and no hex code in this file.

   This deck is AAIF-only, and deliberately so: it imports slides.j2,
   which no other pack ships, so `BRANDING=unbranded task start`
   fails at import rather than re-skinning. A deck that wants to stay
   brand-swappable must import primitives.j2 and nothing else.
   ================================================================ #}

